Description: A program to provide tool-assisted speedrun tools to Linux games

Package: libtas32
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libtas (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: 32-bit libTAS library to run i386 games
 This package provides libtas32.so, which libTAS uses to run 32-bit (i386)
 games on an amd64 system. It needs the i386 versions of libX11, libX11-xcb,
 libasound2, libavutil, libswresample and libswscale.
